@prefix : <http://data.europa.eu/949/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:PathPlanningReferenceLocation a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "PathPlanningReferenceLocation" ;
    rdfs:comment """It has to be indicated whether the path planning
							(direction of construction) is carried out at the traindeparturepoint
							(origin), intermediate or traindestinationpoint. The operation point
							referenced here MUST have a calendar/dayOfDeparture entry - applications
							have to check this.""" .

